		(at 10 8 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "19f5230d-2e9b-4548-9e43-f8ab819974a7")
	)
	(text "Source: hardware/circuits/ch-tg-trigger.md. Everything on this sheet except the optocoupler / photoMOS LED sides and the ADuM1250 logic side is in the 12 V power domain (GND_P). Each pin carries its net as a global label."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 16 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "171d6eb1-2747-4f20-9cf2-3fc55520e14d")
	)
	(text "References in the 500 series. R503..R511 measurement dividers, R512/R513 amplifier A (gain 3), R514/R515 amplifier B (gain -1), U506 = U14 ADuM1250, U507/U508 = U16/U17 MCP4725, U509 = U18 TL072, U510 = U19 4052, U501 = U10, U502 = U11, U503 = U12, U504 = U13, U505 = U20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 21 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1031003a-a822-4c90-a388-b6216f514e4e")
	)
	(text "WARNING: this board carries no HV, but the CDI makes 200-400 V and the coil makes kV. Fire the CDI only into a coil and spark gap in a closed non-conductive box. See docs/safety.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 26 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "a5a7f2f5-fe30-42e1-987a-713b7fda1303")
	)
